  "Book pages 700-715 = PDF pages 1-16 of 'Sec 7 - Avn.pdf' (book page - 699).",
  "The orgs mentioned exist on gr; however, owing to the ongoing restructuring of Army Avn, these orgs are subj to minor changes (p 701).",
  "Org charts give no manpower figures. Aircraft counts printed inside a flt box are read as per flt (e.g. '3 x Cbt Flt / 3x Attk Hel / 2 x Scout Hel').",
  "Re-checked against the book on 15 Nov 2026, every page looked at as an image: the org charts (pp 701-705) print no personnel figure, no armament and no vehicles for any HQ, sqn, flt, coy or pl; only aircraft by kind and number. Aircraft are kept in equipment (kind helicopter / fixed-wing).",
  "Unit-level equipment lists each holder (heldBy, 'each ...' = per flt). The same aircraft are also on the Sqn HQ / flt box nodes (children[].equipment, or the linked flt unit). aircraftTotals gives the sqn totals worked out from the chart (not printed).",
  "The charts name aircraft only by kind (Attk Hel, Scout Hel, LOH, Utility Hel, Air Aslt Hel, Cargo Hel, FW ac); the book does not say which type equips which sqn. avnData lists the Army Avn types by their printed possible roles."
 ],
